# While Working As Sr Product Manager At Morningstar, Gurgaon

Goal:
The business goal was to reduce the enterprise customer onboarding time by > 50% of what it was currently(20-30 days, depending on data complexity)

Solution:
As the product manager of customer onboarding, I came up with the product vision and strategy. I performed the following tasks in order to built the app from scratch:
- mapped out the current workflow by talking to correct stakeholders
- outlined the requirement & tasks
- task prioritisation with stakeholders
- wrote user stories & created wireframes

Impact:
Reduced the customer’s data analysis time, during onboarding, from 12 days to 2-3 days.

