# While Working As Senior Product Manager At Payoneer, Gurgaon

Challenge:
Our workforce management system used bank networks to make international payments, and this process was slow (3-5 days time), expensive(high currency conversion & transfer fee).

Scope Of Work:
I surveyed contractors working out of LATAM to understand what kind of wallets they use on daily basis for money transactions.
I performed comparative analysis for most common multi currency wallets to zero on to our top 2 wallets to integrate. Write down the scope of the prototype & beta release.

Impact:
Reduced payment transfer time from 3-5 days to less than 1 days. Reduced transfer fee to almost 0$ & reduced foreign exchange charges by >50%. 
